    {"id": "db-tables", "type": "text", "x": 55, "y": 475, "width": 880, "height": 65, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "text": "🗄 Supabase Auth (Google OAuth + Email)  →  user_profiles (RBAC: student / teacher)\n🗄 session_replays (rrweb events + canvas snapshots)  →  interventions (live struggle feed)\n🗄 skills (self-referencing tree, 30+ seeded skills)  |  user_skills (mastery 0.00-1.00)\n🗄 skill_prerequisites (DAG for learning dependencies)  →  Realtime subscriptions (live dashboard)", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top"},

